      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART III, LINE 3</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>ALTHOUGH THE I6 FUNDING CONCLUDED, THE WORK OF THAT PARTICULAR PROGRAM WAS INCORPORATED INTO BASE PROGRAMMING OF THE SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA ENERGY INNOVATION NETWORK AND CONTINUES TO THIS DAY.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION B, LINE 11B</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE FORM 990 REVIEW PROCESS INVOLVES ISSUANCE BY AN INDEPENDENT TAX FIRM AND REVIEWED BY THE AUDIT COMMITTEE, CHAIR AND CFO. A COMPLETE COPY OF THE FORM 990 AND SUPPORTING SCHEDULE IS PROVIDED TO THE BOARD FOR REVIEW PRIOR TO THE FILING.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION B, LINE 12C</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>ALL BOARD MEMBERS ARE REQUESTED TO DISCLOSE ANY POTENTIAL OR CURRENT CONFLICTS OF INTEREST. IF A CONFLICT ARISES, THE PERSON WITH THE CONFLICT IS NOT ALLOWED TO VOTE ON THE TRANSACTION.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION B, LINE 15</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE COMPENSATION OF OFFICERS AND KEY EMPLOYEES ARE DISCUSSED AND APPROVED BY THE ORGANIZATION'S EXECUTIVE COMMITTEE. THE COMMITTEE CONSIDERS COMPARABILITY DATA AND COMPENSATION/SALARY STUDIES; FURTHER DUE DILIGENCE MAY INVOLVE REVIEW OF OTHER SIMILAR NON-PROFIT ORGANIZATIONS. THIS PROCESS WAS LAST DONE DEC 2022.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION C, LINE 19</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE ORGANIZATION MAKES ITS FINANCIAL STATEMENTS AVAILABLE ON ITS WEBSITE AND PUBLISHED IN ITS ANNUAL REPORT. GOVERNING DOCUMENTS AND CONFLICT OF INTEREST POLICY ARE MADE AVAILABLE UPON REQUEST.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
